# Vendored plugin bundles are byte-exact copies of upstream files, verified by
# sha256 in bundles/<plugin>/PROVENANCE.json (scripts/sync-vendored-bundles.py).
# Some upstream Markdown depends on trailing spaces. Never convert line endings
# or flag whitespace in the sources or in their generated plugin views; the
# sync check requires one plugins/<plugin> line per bundle.
bundles/** -text -whitespace
plugins/backchain/** -text -whitespace
